{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>黃心穎愛犬「可樂」早前離世，今日她送別狗狗，為狗狗摺九色蓮花、紙船及紙鶴，送上最後祝福，她發長文再悼念愛犬：「My sweetest boi, rest rest la.媽咪會好好記住你肥paw paw嘅感覺，臭feet feet嘅味道，同埋挨埋嚟拗呵嘅重量。願九色蓮花圓滿你呢一生，帶住最大最大嘅祝福到下一站。Love you可樂」。藝人姚子羚、黃智雯和趙希洛都留言送上慰問。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:24:02.960570+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T13:47:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T17:17:34.760929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:16.602875+00:00","content_hash":"50a5a3ecfae3de26bdd9db4cef9fb2a1fcb0a64b9f1a3e88f70cc4ba327a7024","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:24:02.960570+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}